CHAPTER.VERS:
And Moses said to the people, Don't be afraid: for God has come to prove you

          {+}
        , and that his fear may be before you

          {+}
        , that you

          {+}
         don't sin.

And Yahweh said to Moses, Thus you will say to the sons of Israel, You

          {+}
         yourselves have seen that I have talked with you

          {+}
         from heaven.

You

          {+}
         will not make me [into anything]. Gods of silver or gods of gold you

          {+}
         will not make for yourselves.
